    openProblems: ["Half of patients do not respond to PD-1 blockade and have no effective second line.", "Immunosuppressed patients: high incidence, poor outcomes, contraindications to immunotherapy.", "No validated adjuvant standard yet despite ADMEC-O.", "Rarity limits trial size; registries (e.g. Seattle) carry much of the evidence."],
