    pipeline: ["lurbinectedin", "ifosfamide", "car-t", "kc1036"],
    openProblems: ["Metastatic-to-bone and relapsed disease: survival under 20-30%.", "EWSR1-FLI1 remains undrugged after 30 years.", "Late effects: cardiotoxicity, infertility, secondary leukaemia (etoposide, alkylators), radiation-induced sarcoma.", "Ancestry-linked incidence differences (GGAA microsatellite polymorphism) unexplained."],
