    openProblems: ["Access to effective chemotherapy and ART-linked cancer care in sub-Saharan Africa.", "KS in people with suppressed HIV and normal CD4 counts (unexplained).", "No antiviral therapy targets latent KSHV.", "Endemic childhood KS in Africa still lacks access to the chemotherapy that treats it."],
